Conventions purpose page template
title end

paragraph start
A purpose page explains one folder: what it holds, what is planned for it, and which files still need planning. It uses the default file type and is named zero zero, the folder name, and purpose and plan.
paragraph end

paragraph start
It stays general. It describes the folder and never holds content that belongs in a subject file.
paragraph end

